            "review_title": "Review at Kiri Izakaya Đà Lạt",
            "review_text": "Quốc Huy N\n1 contribution\n0\ncould be 4.5/5 star\nDec 2025 • Solo\nKiri Izakaya, offers an authentic Japanese gastropub experience in the heart of Da Lat. The food is meticulously prepared, featuring smoky, flavorful Yakitori (grilled skewers) and incredibly fresh Sashimi that melts in your mouth.\n\nTo complement the meal, their selection of traditional Sake and refreshing Highballs are absolute must-tries. The cozy, dimly lit atmosphere perfectly mimics a hidden Tokyo alley, making it a sublime escape from the chilly Da Lat night. It is a top-tier spot for anyone seeking high-quality Japanese cuisine and a soulful \"chill\" vibe.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 19, 2025",
